=== PREFLIGHT CONTRACT: api/openapi.json ===
Title: CardioMap 3D API
Version: 0.2.0
Description (Disclaimer):
CardioMap 3D is for decision support and educational purposes only. It is not a medical device and not a substitute for formal diagnostic imaging (such as coronary angiography) or professional clinical judgment.

=== ENDPOINTS ===
POST /explain -> Explain Stenosis Prediction
GET /health -> Health Check
GET /metrics -> Get Metrics Report
GET /patients/samples -> Get Sample Patients
POST /predict -> Predict Stenosis Risk
GET /schema -> Get Schema

=== SCHEMAS ===
Schema CutoffThreshold: properties=['operating_threshold', 'threshold', 'moderate_min', 'high_min', 'high_threshold', 'cohort_prevalence']
Schema ExplainResponse: properties=['targets', 'requested_targets', 'physiology', 'explainer', 'api_version', 'model_version', 'interpretation_note', 'disclaimer']
Schema ExplainerMetadata: properties=['method', 'background_size', 'nsamples', 'unit', 'note', 'stability_note']
Schema FeatureExplanation: properties=['feature', 'display_label', 'patient_value', 'shap_value', 'relative_contribution_pct', 'direction', 'stability_label']
Schema HTTPValidationError: properties=['detail']
Schema HealthResponse: properties=['status', 'app_name', 'api_version', 'model_version', 'artifact_hash', 'artifacts_ready', 'disclaimer']
Schema MetricsResponse: properties=['deployed_models', 'candidate_comparison', 'clinical_baseline_comparison', 'nested_tuning_config', 'disclosures']
Schema PhysiologyItem: properties=['feature', 'display_label', 'category', 'patient_value', 'relative_contribution_pct', 'direction', 'stability_label']
Schema PredictResponse: properties=['cad', 'vessels', 'coherence', 'imputed_features', 'warnings', 'api_version', 'model_version', 'disclaimer']
Schema SamplePatient: properties=['sample_id', 'dataset_row_index', 'cad_probability', 'risk_tier', 'features']
Schema SchemaResponse: properties=['api_version', 'model_version', 'artifact_hash', 'disclaimer', 'feature_schema', 'risk_cutoffs', 'margin']
Schema TargetExplanation: properties=['target', 'raw_unit', 'base_value', 'contributions']
Schema TargetPrediction: properties=['probability', 'label', 'risk_level', 'cohort_prevalence', 'relative_risk', 'threshold', 'high_threshold']
Schema ValidationError: properties=['loc', 'msg', 'type', 'input', 'ctx']

=== RISK_LEVEL VALUES ===
RiskLevel enum: None